								<p class="newsTitle">
									Defeat.... - 
									7/31/2005 10:46:44 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Defeat......you can smell it in the air. LMM went down crying! Congrats to all the newly flagged peeps. This means we are that much closer to defeating the PoP Gods. Soon OR will be knocking on the doors to the Elemental Planes.
								</div>
							</td>
	</tr><tr>
