	</tr><tr>
		<td class="grid_col2" align="Center">
								<p class="newsTitle">
									Moving Right Along - 
									7/13/2005 6:42:57 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									Last night was our final success versus Terris Thule on an official raid night!&nbsp; That wraps up Tier One for OR and gives us some room to start adding Tier Three targets to keep things moving.&nbsp; Our current targets on rotation are Carp/Bert, Saryrn, RD, and LMM.&nbsp; That just leaves us with TZ, VZ, RZTW, Agnarr, and Sol Ro before elementals.&nbsp; Now that I'm typing that it seems like a lot, but anyway we're more than halfway along! <br /> 
								</div>
							</td>
