									Bertoxxolous - 
									6/17/2005 9:13:21 AM
								</p>
								<div class="newsBody">
									OR had our first success versus Bertoxxolous Friday night, rounding out an even 10 vanquished planar targets!&nbsp; The event was fast, furious, and if I heard correctly over in an hour.&nbsp; Everyone did a great job staying focused, picking up adds, and keeping everyone healed throughout the bruhaha.&nbsp; Grats to Wildwind and Raynelyn for their Symbols of the Plaguebringer!<br /> 
